<div class="home-about">
    <p class="home-about-lead">
        Fellowship Analyzer reads the combat logs you upload to
        <a href="https://www.fellowshiplogs.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fellowship Logs</a>
        and runs hero-specific analysis over them, turning raw events into actionable suggestions and statistics.
    </p>
    <p class="home-about-body">
        Paste a report or character link above to analyse a fight. Each report is analysed per hero, so the
        feedback and statistics you see are tailored to the hero you played.
    </p>

    <div class="home-about-section">
        <h3 class="home-about-heading">Support levels</h3>
        <p class="home-about-body">
            The Heroes tab marks how complete each hero's analysis is:
        </p>
        <dl class="home-about-legend">
            <div class="home-about-legend-row">
                <dt><SupportBadge Support="SupportLevel.Full" /></dt>
                <dd>This hero's analysis is largely complete.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="home-about-legend-row">
                <dt><SupportBadge Support="SupportLevel.Partial" /></dt>
                <dd>This hero's analysis is still being built out.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="home-about-legend-row">
                <dt><SupportBadge Support="SupportLevel.Minimal" /></dt>
                <dd>This hero's analysis is incomplete and likely inaccurate.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="home-about-legend-row">
                <dt><SupportBadge Support="SupportLevel.None" /></dt>
                <dd>This hero has no analysis yet.</dd>
            </div>
        </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="home-about-section">
        <h3 class="home-about-heading">Contribute</h3>
        <p class="home-about-body">
            Fellowship Analyzer is open source. Adding a hero, improving analysis, or fixing a bug is welcome on
            <a href="https://github.com/Seriousnes/FellowshipAnalyzer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
